==English==
[[Image:Beached coconut.JPG|thumb|right|300px|Beached '''coconut''']]

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# The [[fruit]] of the [[coconut palm]], ''[[Cocos]] [[nucifera]]'', having a [[fibrous]] [[husk]] surrounding a large [[seed]].
# The hard-shelled [[seed]] of this fruit, having white flesh and a [[fluid]]-filled central [[cavity]].
# The [[edible]] white flesh of this fruit.
# The [[coconut palm]].
# {{pejorative}} A [[Hispanic]] person who acts “white” (Western).  Coconuts are brown on the ourtide and white on the inside.
# {{context|South African|pejorative}} A [[black]] person who thinks "white" (European).
# {{context|New Zealand|pejorative}} A [[Pacific islander]].

====Derived terms====
* [[coconut milk]]
* [[coconutty]]

